ies for your flashlight, healing items, ammo, keys, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory is limited. Share with your team or keep it for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/9ddceb66a74989f17c327cb09db97a36.avif?t=1769006947\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/50672b427b88b1afe52db6004bcc544c.poster.avif?t=1769006947\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/50672b427b88b1afe52db6004bcc544c.webm?t=1769006947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/50672b427b88b1afe52db6004bcc544c.mp4?t=1769006947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It listens to your footsteps. It tracks your voice. It observes your strategies and adapts.<br>Every decision matters, and every sound you make brings death one step closer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/02207108dc330da7803ff9d75edb0da5.avif?t=1769006947\" width=418 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/802002fa538caf119e71116022782650.poster.avif?t=1769006947\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/802002fa538caf119e71116022782650.webm?t=1769006947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/extras/802002fa538caf119e71116022782650.mp4?t=1769006947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From derelict hospitals and underground bunkers to dark forests and empty corridors, every location oozes tension.<br>Flickering lights. Distant echoes. Breathing in your headset. Footsteps that aren\u2019t yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Serundeox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894440/27f13378bada38b9e1e7f8d0a09d16c7e042a406/header.jpg?t=1769006947","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894440/1998426840/f0b18dca46b197c67f567608ea157b7e564780a1/1764973121/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764974257","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894440/1998426840/f0b18dca46b197c67f567608ea157b7e564780a1/1764973121/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764974257","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894440/1998426840/f0b18dca46b197c67f567608ea157b7e564780a1/1764973121/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764974257","id":257244135,"name":"EarlyFootageTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257244135/0547f6ffe98ecf31ee0255cf7cbe4a1658e0092a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764974257"}],"name":"NO BACKUP","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 \uff0f Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  AMD Radeon RX 470 with 4GB VRAM \uff0f NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 with 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><